  "description": "Managed (.NET) bindings for the Group Protocol Stack: a layered, end-to-end encrypted group-messaging protocol family built on top of MLS (RFC 9420). Bundles the native runtime library (gbp_stack) for every supported runtime identifier (win-x64, win-arm64, linux-x64, linux-arm64, osx-x64, osx-arm64) — works out of the box on every supported platform.",
